      "text": "∥F(x, u) −F(y, u)∥≤L∥x −y∥",
      "bbox": [
        68.76798248291016,
        705.2750244140625,
        206.35150146484375,
        722.5601196289062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "∥F(x, u) −F(x, v)∥= ∥g(x)(u −v)∥≤Lu∥u −v∥",
      "bbox": [
        68.76798248291016,
        720.2190551757812,
        284.0389404296875,
        737.504150390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thus, according to Corollary 3.17 and Gr¨onwall Comparison",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        55.233333587646484,
        558.0005493164062,
        64.18891143798828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lemma in [20], we have:",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        67.23834228515625,
        417.269287109375,
        76.14490509033203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "∥ϕ(t, x, u) −ϕ(t, y, u)∥",
      "bbox": [
        336.1039733886719,
        84.95098114013672,
        432.89056396484375,
        102.23609161376953
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤eLt∥x −y∥+ Lu",
      "bbox": [
        338.8719787597656,
        105.6811752319336,
        419.7392883300781,
        124.19910430908203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Z t",
      "bbox": [
        421.9009704589844,
        96.23421478271484,
        434.87567138671875,
        107.05159759521484
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "0",
      "bbox": [
        427.4349670410156,
        118.8722152709961,
        431.4100341796875,
        125.06495666503906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "eL(t−s)∥u(s) −u(s)∥ds",
      "bbox": [
        437.0309753417969,
        105.2906494140625,
        535.1207275390625,
        124.19910430908203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "= eLt∥x −y∥",
      "bbox": [
        338.87200927734375,
        126.62618255615234,
        396.0758361816406,
        145.1441192626953
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤reLt,",
      "bbox": [
        338.87200927734375,
        142.08120727539062,
        370.5415954589844,
        160.5980987548828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where equality is held because two trajectories have the same",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        162.9593505859375,
        558.0009155273438,
        171.86590576171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "input trajectory.",
      "bbox": [
        313.20001220703125,
        174.91436767578125,
        377.189697265625,
        183.8209228515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose x∗",
      "bbox": [
        323.16302490234375,
        184.7786865234375,
        373.980712890625,
        195.77593994140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=",
      "bbox": [
        384.2740173339844,
        186.70997619628906,
        392.0249328613281,
        195.5567626953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "arg minx∗∈∂S sd(ϕ(t, x, u), S), y∗",
      "bbox": [
        401.81817626953125,
        184.7786865234375,
        539.9576416015625,
        203.18812561035156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=",
      "bbox": [
        550.2509765625,
        186.70997619628906,
        558.0018920898438,
        195.5567626953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "arg miny∗∈∂S sd(ϕ(t, y, u), S). The three cases are analyzed",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        197.8580322265625,
        558.017578125,
        215.1431427001953
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "as follows:",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        210.7803955078125,
        357.3940124511719,
        219.68695068359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Case 1: ϕ(t, x, u) and ϕ(t, y, u) are both in S, and then",
      "bbox": [
        323.1629638671875,
        222.5760040283203,
        558.0213623046875,
        231.6419677734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we have",
      "bbox": [
        313.199951171875,
        234.6904296875,
        346.7639465332031,
        243.59698486328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "|sd(ϕ(t, x, u), S) −sd(ϕ(t, y, u), S)|",
      "bbox": [
        360.89593505859375,
        252.404052734375,
        509.9065246582031,
        269.68914794921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=|∥ϕ(t, x, u) −x∗∥−∥ϕ(t, y, u) −y∗∥|",
      "bbox": [
        353.14794921875,
        265.7247314453125,
        517.6028442382812,
        284.6331787109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤|∥ϕ(t, x, u) −x∗∥−∥ϕ(t, y, u) −x∗∥|",
      "bbox": [
        353.14794921875,
        280.6687316894531,
        518.0548095703125,
        299.5771789550781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤∥ϕ(t, x, u) −ϕ(t, y, u)∥",
      "bbox": [
        353.1479187011719,
        297.236083984375,
        457.6854248046875,
        314.52117919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤reLt,",
      "bbox": [
        353.1479187011719,
        311.4582824707031,
        382.04949951171875,
        329.9751892089844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where the first equality follows from the definition, and the",
      "bbox": [
        313.19989013671875,
        332.3364562988281,
        558.0009155273438,
        341.2430114746094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "first inequality follows from the triangle inequality.",
      "bbox": [
        313.19989013671875,
        344.29144287109375,
        522.7828979492188,
        353.197998046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Case 2: ϕ(t, x, u) and ϕ(t, y, u) are both not in S, and",
      "bbox": [
        323.16290283203125,
        356.0870361328125,
        558.021240234375,
        365.1529846191406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "then with the same reason, similarly, we have",
      "bbox": [
        313.19989013671875,
        368.2024230957031,
        500.9649353027344,
        377.1089782714844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "|sd(ϕ(t, x, u), S) −sd(ϕ(t, y, u), S)|",
      "bbox": [
        360.8968811035156,
        385.9150390625,
        509.9075012207031,
        403.20013427734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=|∥ϕ(t, x, u) −x∗∥−∥ϕ(t, y, u) −y∗∥|",
      "bbox": [
        353.14788818359375,
        399.2366943359375,
        517.602783203125,
        418.1441345214844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤|∥ϕ(t, x, u) −x∗∥−∥ϕ(t, y, u) −x∗∥|",
      "bbox": [
        353.14788818359375,
        414.1806945800781,
        518.0547485351562,
        433.088134765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤∥ϕ(t, x, u) −ϕ(t, y, u)∥",
      "bbox": [
        353.1478576660156,
        430.7470397949219,
        457.68536376953125,
        448.0321350097656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤reLt,",
      "bbox": [
        353.1478576660156,
        444.9692077636719,
        382.0494384765625,
        463.48712158203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Case 3: One of ϕ(t, x, u) and ϕ(t, y, u) is in S and the",
      "bbox": [
        323.162841796875,
        465.6889953613281,
        558.0210571289062,
        474.75494384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "other not in S. Without loss of generality, we can assume that",
      "bbox": [
        313.1998291015625,
        477.64398193359375,
        558.000732421875,
        486.7099304199219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ϕ(t, x, u) is in S and ϕ(t, y, u) is not in S. Then there at least",
      "bbox": [
        313.1998291015625,
        489.5989685058594,
        558.0206909179688,
        498.6649169921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "exists a λ ∈[0, 1] such that λϕ(t, x, u) + (1 −λ)ϕ(t, y, u) ∈",
      "bbox": [
        313.1998291015625,
        500.7469787597656,
        558.0304565429688,
        518.0321044921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "∂S and we denote p∗:= λϕ(t, x, u)+(1−λ)ϕ(t, y, u) ∈∂S,",
      "bbox": [
        313.1998291015625,
        511.57763671875,
        558.0300903320312,
        529.987060546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "thus, we have",
      "bbox": [
        313.1998291015625,
        525.623291015625,
        369.3490295410156,
        534.5298461914062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "|sd(ϕ(t, x, u), S) −sd(ϕ(t, y, u), S)|",
      "bbox": [
        362.9618225097656,
        543.3369750976562,
        511.9724426269531,
        560.6220703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=∥ϕ(t, y, u) −y∗∥+ ∥ϕ(t, x, u) −x∗∥",
      "bbox": [
        355.21282958984375,
        556.6585693359375,
        514.131103515625,
        575.5660400390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤∥ϕ(t, x, u) −p∗∥+ ∥ϕ(t, y, u) −p∗∥|",
      "bbox": [
        355.21282958984375,
        571.6026000976562,
        515.9896850585938,
        590.510009765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "=∥ϕ(t, x, u) −ϕ(t, y, u)∥",
      "bbox": [
        355.2127990722656,
        588.1689453125,
        459.75030517578125,
        605.4540405273438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "≤reLt,",
      "bbox": [
        355.2127990722656,
        602.39111328125,
        384.1143798828125,
        620.9090576171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where the first equality and the first inequality follow from",
      "bbox": [
        313.1997985839844,
        623.2703247070312,
        558.0006713867188,
        632.1768798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the definition of the signed distance function, and the second",
      "bbox": [
        313.1997985839844,
        635.225341796875,
        558.0007934570312,
        644.1318969726562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "equality follows from the definition of p∗. In all cases,",
      "bbox": [
        313.1997985839844,
        645.089599609375,
        557.9996337890625,
        656.0868530273438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we obtain |sd(ϕ(t, x, u), S) −sd(ϕ(t, y, u), S)| ≤reLt as",
      "bbox": [
        313.19976806640625,
        655.5203247070312,
        557.9995727539062,
        675.4540405273438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "required.",
      "bbox": [
        313.1997375488281,
        671.09033203125,
        348.8857421875,
        679.9968872070312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    }
